# This repo is LF-only, pure ASCII in debloat/*.ps1 and *.json (target: Windows
# PowerShell 5.1, and any byte change - including a line-ending flip - would break a
# future Authenticode signature). Without this file, a Windows git client or a Windows
# GitHub Actions runner can check these files out as CRLF via core.autocrlf, even though
# the committed blobs are genuinely LF - confirmed for real: the CI lint job failed on
# exactly this after actions/checkout on windows-latest, despite every file being
# verified LF-only before every commit all session.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
